le-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;—&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Пользователь передает логин и пароль в сервис авторизации\аутентификации&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;9&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Подтверждение входа в систему&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;Сервис аутентификации\авторизации при успехе возвращает JWT токен, который содержит в том числе и роль пользователя.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;10. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Получение списка торговых площадок&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— Сервис торговых площадок получает в запросе фильтр, включающий Пользователь.ID и другие атрибуты торговых площадок. В отчет возвращается список торговых площадок, удовлетворяющий условиям фильтра&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;11. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;Регистрация пользователя на торговой площадке&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— Сервис торговых площадок получает в запросе Пользователь.ID и Торговая площадка.ID, регистрирует эту связь.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;12.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Получение списка товаров и доступных пользователю торговых площадок&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;— Микрофронтенд товаров отправляет запрос в &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;BFF товаров&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; на получение списка товаров и доступных торговых площадок.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, Bli