ing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); font-weight: 400; text-indent: -21px; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;25.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); text-indent: -21px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Редактирование аукциона&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— Администратор&amp;nbsp;редактирует аукцион. В запросе передается Заявка.ID и обновленные параметры аукциона&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;26. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;Запрос на совершение оплаты&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— Сервис заказов или Сервис аукционов отправляют событие в Сервис уведомлений об необходимой оплате. Сервис оплаты узнает об этом событии и начинает обработку события&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;27.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Обновление статуса оплаты&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— Сервис оплаты изменяет статус оплаты на основании результата процесса оплаты. Он передает данные в Сервис уведомлений&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 21px; text-indent: -21px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(14, 14, 14);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); font-weight: 400; text-indent: -21px; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;28. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); text-indent: -21px; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Уведомление об изменении&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); text-indent: -21px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;статуса оплаты&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— Сервис уведомлений публикует уведомление об изменении статуса оплаты в соответствии с его типом&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); text-indent: -21px; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;29.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); text-indent: -21px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Пользователь создает заявку в тех поддержку&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— Микрофронтенд техподдержки отправляет запрос в Сервис техподдержки на создание заявки в техподдержку&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;30.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); text-indent: -21px;&quot;&gt;Пользователь создает заявку в на апелляцию&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-indent: -21px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— Микрофронтенд техподдержки отправляет запрос в Сервис техподдержки на создание заявки на апелляцию&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); text-indent: -21px; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;31.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); text-indent: -21px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Регистрация заявки в техподдержку&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;— Специалист техподдержки регистрирует заявку в техподдержку&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: -21px; background-color: initial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &amp;quot;YS Text&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(14, 14, 14), rgb(225, 225, 225)); font-size: 15px; back